         "color": "#1E3A43"
        }
       },
       "html": "<p>My name is Kennedy Porter and I went on the Irish Life Experience in 2018!&nbsp; I am from Columbus, Ohio and am currently a junior.&nbsp; I was able to go on this amazing trip through the Shamrock Club of Columbus, as well as through the support and encouragement of my friends and family.&nbsp; I would deeply encourage everyone to go on this trip for many reasons.&nbsp; One is traveling to other parts of the world is one of the most fulfilling experiences you will have in your life.&nbsp; Another is the people on this trip rock and make it ten times more fun than just going on your own!!!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I hope you all apply and see the wonders and beauty of Ireland!</p>"
